1
00:00:00,715 --> 00:00:02,455
(Sheldon:)And there's the clown
that came out of her.

2
00:00:07,388 --> 00:00:09,728
(Sheldon:)I really didn't want
to come here,

3
00:00:09,891 --> 00:00:11,671
(Sheldon:)but this is shaping up to be

4
00:00:11,826 --> 00:00:14,206
(Sheldon:)one of the best Thanksgivings
I've had in a long time.

5
00:00:14,362 --> 00:00:15,862
(Penny:)Me, too.

6
00:00:16,631 --> 00:00:19,471
Hey. Howard says you've
been making fun of him all day!

7
00:00:19,634 --> 00:00:22,474
Now, both of you apologize right now!

8
00:00:23,338 --> 00:00:24,978
(Sheldon:)She's so tiny.

9
00:00:29,077 --> 00:00:31,247
(Sheldon:)It's funny when she's mad.

10
00:00:34,816 --> 00:00:36,226
(Amy:)All right, mister, I think you owe

11
00:00:36,384 --> 00:00:39,224
(Amy:)Howard and Bernadette an apology.

12
00:00:40,488 --> 00:00:41,868
(Sheldon:)Perhaps you're right.

13
00:00:44,359 --> 00:00:45,669
I'm sorry for my behavior.

14
00:00:45,827 --> 00:00:47,867
(Sheldon:)I've had alcohol,
and it's caused me

15
00:00:48,029 --> 00:00:49,069
(Sheldon:)to be inappropriate.

16
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:51,070
(Bernadette:)-It's okay.
-Don't worry about it.

17
00:00:51,232 --> 00:00:52,612
(Penny:)Thank you.

18
00:00:53,167 --> 00:00:54,667
(Sheldon:)Ain't she great?

19
00:00:55,737 --> 00:00:56,777
(Leonard:)Sheldon.

20
00:00:57,071 --> 00:01:12,031
(Sheldon:)Now, how's about you get
us a couple of beers?

